  "description": "DotTorch.Optimizers provides first-class implementations of gradient-based optimization algorithms for training neural networks in .NET 8 and .NET 9 environments.\n\t\t\tThe library includes essential optimizers such as SGD, Momentum, RMSprop, Adam, and more.\n\t\t\tIt is fully compatible with DotTorch.Core and supports dynamic computation graphs, automatic differentiation, and batched parameter updates.\n\t\t\tOptimizers can be seamlessly integrated into training loops and customized for research and production use.\n\t\t\tDesigned with extensibility, testability, and high-performance execution in mind, it empowers developers to efficiently train deep learning models on CPU and GPU.",
